WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Collect: an authorized LDAPS read gathers directory data,
including certificate templates. This is a synthetic illustration.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
Inspect: template rules evaluate configuration.
No certificate is issued by this check.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.500
Retain context: JSON findings link the rule, affected object,
explanation, and remediation. This is not captured tool output.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
Review permissions, CA settings, patches, and scope separately.
A configuration signal is not proof of exploitation.
